WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.090
Here's how to install the ChatGPT app on Windows,

2
00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.130
and connect it to a server over SSH.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.380
Open the Microsoft Store and search for ChatGPT.

4
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:16.450
Pick the app published by OpenAI,

5
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.050
then click Get.

6
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.760
When it's installed, click Open and log in.

7
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.050
Then open Settings, and Connections under Coding.

8
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.490
Click Add, type the server's address,

9
00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.810
give it a short alias, and save.

10
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:41.160
Switch it on. The first try usually fails,

11
00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:44.120
because passwordless login isn't set up yet.

12
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:52.150
Open a new local chat, and ask Codex to fix passwordless login and give you the script to run.

13
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.220
In a separate terminal, log in to the server with your password,

14
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.580
run the script, then type done in the chat.

15
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:07.090
If Codex isn't installed on the server,

16
00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:09.090
ask it to install it there too.

17
00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:17.240
Back in Settings, click Reconnect. When you're asked to sign in,

18
00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:21.080
use your work email, and wait until it says Connected.

19
00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:24.710
Pick a project folder on the server,

20
00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:26.390
and you're ready to go.
